TargetFinder Toolkit
--------------------
License: MIT
https://github.com/ahmedbenakouche/target_finder_toolkit

kill-mouse uses TargetFinder (PyPI: `target-finder-toolkit`) for GUI-widget
detection (YOLO26 UI models) and adapts its PyQt6 click-through overlay pattern
(WindowTransparentForInput + WA_TranslucentBackground). Magnetic cursor snap
logic is original to kill-mouse.

Paper: "TargetFinder: Detecting Widgets from Pixels on Desktop Interfaces"

